<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58782" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμ-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hair of the head</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				22.406
			</span></i>, etc.: less freq. in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κὰδ δὲ κάρητος οὔλας ἧκε κόμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.231
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμαι Χαρίτεσσιν ὁμοῖαι</span>
			(i.e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμαις Χαρίτων</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.51
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμην κείρειν, κείρεσθαι</span>
			(v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείρω</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">;
				κόμην τρέφειν</span> to let <i>the hair</i> grow long,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.82
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. φορεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGnom.</u>
					188
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμη δι᾽ αὔρας ἀκτένιστος ᾄσσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1261
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθεῖσαν εἰς ὤμους κόμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					695
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμαι πρόσθετοι</span> false
				<i>hair, wig</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.3.2
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοῦλος ὢν κόμην
			ἔχεις</span>; <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				911
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμης ἀνάπλεως</span>
			<i>unkempt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cic.</u>
				30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the
				<i>beard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				4.8.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>gill</i> or <i>branchia</i> of the cuttlefish, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				550b18
			</span></i>: pl., <i>arms</i> or <i>suckers</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				4.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>foliage</i> of trees, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				23.195
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				296
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόνακος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					4.28
				</span></i>
			; of herbs, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.164.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.268
			</span></i>; of corn, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ληΐου κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					88.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειμώνων κόμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1389i
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				i 11
			</span></i>; esp. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραγοπώγων</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.7.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.143
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>luminous tail of a comet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				343a1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				346a15
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
